y  on cloud code's cloud run emulator check  the link in the description with info on  how to do this  setup only takes a second for local  development  accessing this secret from cloud code's  cloud run emulator  automatically works no need to worry  about authentication  and there we have it the contents of my  secret  i can also create a new version of my  secret by right clicking it and  selecting new version  since the function i added grabs the  latest secret version by default  i can refresh my service and see my new  secret value  that's a quick look at cloud code secret  manager support if you have any  questions or feature requests about  cloud code  join our slack channel
 

